  "body": "This has stub implementations and tests for all of the classes described in the spec, and enough of BaseReadableStream implemented to handle adapting push streams. Implementation follows the spec as close to literally as possible.\n\nOnly inconsistency found so far is that some of the examples depend on the value returned by `[[push]]`, which isn't defined in the spec. (Filed as whatwg/streams#54.)\n",
